# 021-ceramics.map - the world's wiring for the ceramic engine (issue 109).
#
# Written by hand. Two stations, one per stage of a step. Each is one of the
# program's doors: the host hands chunks of work in at argument 0 (units) and
# argument 1 (cuboids), and collects each chunk's "done" at result 0 and
# result 1. The host hands in the cuboid stage only after every unit chunk
# has landed, because cuboids read the units' new records.

station units (020-ceramic-boxes.c:unit_chunk)
  in 0 - 0$
  out 0 - 0$

station cuboids (020-ceramic-boxes.c:cuboid_chunk)
  in 0 - 1$
  out 0 - 1$
